<h2>libSQL / Turso</h2>
<p>{"%1 is reached through the PHP %2 extension. Install it, enable it in php.ini and start the setup wizard again."|i18n( "design/standard/setup/db",, array( 'libSQL / Turso', 'curl' ) )}</p>
<p>{"A libSQL server (sqld) or Turso is reached over HTTP; without curl the driver also works through PHP's HTTP stream wrapper (allow_url_fopen=On), but the setup wizard offers libSQL only when curl is loaded. The embedded file mode needs PHP's sqlite3 extension as well."|i18n( "design/standard/setup/db" )}</p>
<p>{"More information can be found on"|i18n( "design/standard/setup/db" )} <a href="https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.curl.php">php.net</a>.</p>
